        "answer": {
          "short": "$y=-\\frac94x+\\frac32$; gradient $-\\frac94$, $y$-intercept $\\frac32$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}9x+4y&=6\\\\4y&=-9x+6\\\\y&=-\\frac94x+\\frac64\\\\y&=-\\frac94x+\\frac32\\end{align*}$$\nThe gradient is $-\\frac94$ and the $y$-intercept is $\\frac32$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      },
      {
